            "kind": "File",
            "path": "bin\\NetFramework30ASPNETWEB.dll.config",
            "snippet": "\u003CappSettings\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- Azure Key Vault URI for secure credential management --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cadd key=\u0022KeyVaultUri\u0022 value=\u0022https://your-vault-name.vault.azure.net/\u0022 /\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- \r\n        USAGE EXAMPLE: Retrieve secrets from Azure Key Vault instead of storing plaintext credentials\r\n        \r\n        In your code, replace:\r\n            string connectionString = ConfigurationManager.AppSettings[\u0022ConnectionString\u0022];\r\n            \r\n        With:\r\n            string connectionString = KeyVaultService.Instance.GetSecret(\u0022ConnectionString\u0022);\r\n            \r\n        Or for async methods:\r\n            string apiKey = await KeyVaultService.Instance.GetSecretAsync(\u0022ApiKey\u0022);\r\n            \r\n        Benefits:\r\n        - No plaintext credentials stored in configuration files\r\n        - Centralized secret management via Azure Key Vault\r\n        - Automatic rotation and auditing of secrets\r\n        - Secure authentication via Managed Identity or DefaultAzureCredential\r\n        --\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- Application Insights instrumentation key (set via Azure App Settings) --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cadd key=\u0022APPINSIGHTS_INSTRUMENTATIONKEY\u0022 value=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- Authorized roles for Secure.aspx (Azure AD roles) --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cadd key=\u0022AuthorizedRoles\u0022 value=\u0022SecureAppUsers,AppAdministrators\u0022 /\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- Azure AD configuration (if not using Easy Auth) --\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- \u003Cadd key=\u0022ida:ClientId\u0022 value=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E --\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- \u003Cadd key=\u0022ida:Tenant\u0022 value=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E --\u003E\r\n  \u003C!-- \u003Cadd key=\u0022ida:Domain\u0022 value=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E --\u003E\r\n\u003C/appSettings\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "incidentId": "177f8f60-0f23-432c-89b8-7f787b6a8874",
          "ruleId": "Security.0002",
