    "Local.0009": {
      "id": "Local.0009",
      "description": "Native API calls detected.\n\nThe AppService sandbox generally aims to restrict access to shared OS components. While some Windows native system API might work on AppService sandbox or in containers, many of them are blocked.\n\nIt is also important to avoid native Windows calls if you aim to use AppService or containers based on Linux OS in the future.",
