    "Local.0015": {
      "id": "Local.0015",
      "description": "Writing to Event Tracing for Windows (ETW) detected.\n\nWriting diagnostics to the ETW is an antipattern for Azure-hosted services. Although some tools (like LogMonitor, etc.) can be used to forward ETW events to the console, there are much better logging options, like Azure Monitor and Application Insights, that will be more productive.",
