        }
      ]
    },
    "Local.0004": {
      "id": "Local.0004",
      "description": "Logging to local or network paths detected.\n\nLogging APIs that write to disk might not work on Azure App Service or Container.\n\nUse logging that stores logs in locations outside of the host unless its specifically required by your app. You can also use logging capabilities embedded in Azure, such as Azure App Service logging or Application Insights.\n\nFor migrating to AKS, use LogMonitor tool that can capture logs written to files, the console, or write logs and redirect them to Azure.",
