    "Scale.0003": {
      "id": "Scale.0003",
      "description": "MachineKey dependency is detected.\n\nMachineKey is used in ASP.NET apps to protect (encode) or unprotect (decode) data. It will work in Azure environments however it will impact scalability. Data protected by one instance of an application can only be unprotected by other replicas with the same machine key and it is different on other machines.\n\nA suggested replacement of MachineKey is Microsoft.AspNetCore.DataProtection APIs which work for .NET Framework or .NET.",
